		(descr "Switchcraft 35RAPC2BVN4 vertical 3.5mm TRS (VN4 CD). Component-side view: pad1 (sleeve) at origin; ΔX/ΔY from pad1 (pin2 +2.45/-2.15, pin3 +6.15/0, pin4 +8.05/-2.15, pin5 +11.80/0). 5x oval PTH 0.90x2.00mm drill. Tip=4 Ring=2 Sleeve=1; pads 3+5 NC on 2BVN4. Stagger row toward -Y (+1mm vs VN4 CD 1.15). https://www.switchcraft.com/assets/1/24/35rapc__vn4_cd.pdf")
